{
  "key": 21543,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_DoYouLikeToFish",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Fishing Guru’s younger\n",
        "brother.\r",
        "I simply looove fishing!\n",
        "I can’t bear to go without.\r",
        "Tell me, do you like to fish?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_OhThatsDisappointing",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh…\n",
        "That’s so disappointing…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_PaintWorld_Text_FigureFirst",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "A figure made of paint turns to\n",
        "face you. It raises a brush."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_BlankChartOfSomeSort",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a blank chart of some sort.\r",
        "It has spaces for writing in\n",
        "records of some kind."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_OhMagikarpAllowMeToSee",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh? {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}?\n",
        "Why, if it isn’t a Magikarp!\r",
        "Allow me to see it, quick!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_TakeThisAndFish",
      "en_US": [
        "Grand! I like your style.\n",
        "I think we can be friends.\r",
        "Take this and fish, young friend!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_ReceivedSuperRod",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received a Super Rod from\n",
        "the Fishing Guru’s brother."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_IfYouCatchBigMagikarpShowMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Fishing is a way of life!\n",
        "It is like the finest poetry.\r",
        "From the seas to rivers, go out\n",
        "and land the big one, my friend.\r",
        "Now, I have a request.\r",
        "If you catch a big Magikarp \n",
        "with that Rod, I want to see it.\r",
        "As much as I love to fish, I also\n",
        "love seeing gigantic Magikarp."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_PaintWorld_Text_FigureSketch",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure’s colors swirl.\n",
        "It’s waiting for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_PaintWorld_Text_FigureMega",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure is holding a stone that\n",
        "shines in every color."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_PaintWorld_Text_Dissolve",
      "en_US": [
        "The figure runs like wet paint…\n",
        "The world around it does too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_MostGiganticMagikarpXSize",
      "en_US": [
        "The most gigantic Magikarp\n",
        "I have ever witnessed…\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_TryFishingBringMeMagikarp",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello there, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "Have you been fishing?\r",
        "Try fishing with the Super Rod in\n",
        "any body of water.\r",
        "You’ll find different Pokémon in\n",
        "different places.\r",
        "Oh, and don’t forget to bring me\n",
        "gigantic Magikarp."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_DoesntLookLikeMagikarp",
      "en_US": [
        "Uh… That doesn’t look much like\n",
        "a Magikarp."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_HmmXSizeDoesntMeasureUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm…\n",
        "This one is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} long.\r",
        "It doesn’t measure up to the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} one you brought before."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_WhoaXSizeTakeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …Whoa!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "You have a rare appreciation for\n",
        "the fine, poetic aspects of fishing!\r",
        "You must take this.\n",
        "I insist!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_LookForwardToGreaterRecords",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll look forward to seeing greater\n",
        "records from you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_HuhXSizeSameSizeAsLast",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh?\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}?\r",
        "This is the same size as the one\n",
        "I saw before."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_Route12_FishingHouse_Text_NoRoomForGift",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, no!\r",
        "I had a gift for you, but you have\n",
        "no room for it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0349_R12R0101_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
